    "methods_description": "MEG and EEG data were acquired simultaneously using a Neuromag Vectorview system with a 60-channel EEG electrode cap. Visual stimuli (checkerboard patterns) were presented to the left and right visual fields with 750 ms inter-stimulus intervals, interspersed with tones to the left or right ear. Occasional face stimuli at the center of the visual field required right index finger key presses. Structural MRI was acquired on a Siemens 1.5 T Sonata scanner using an MPRAGE sequence.",
